      "rdfs:label": "Squidward",
      "rdfs:comment": "Squidward Quincy Tentacles is a fictional character in Nickelodeon's animated television series SpongeBob SquarePants. Created and designed by marine biologist and animator Stephen Hillenburg, he is voiced by actor Rodger Bumpass. Squidward first appeared on television in the series' pilot episode \"Help Wanted\" on May 1, 1999.",
